        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: 3rd Marine Division (United States)\n- Places: Camp Courtney\n- People: Major Henry A. Courtney Jr.\n- Events: Operation Iceberg, Battle of Okinawa\n\nFacts:\n- Operation Iceberg was the codename for the Battle of Okinawa.\n- Major Henry A. Courtney Jr. was killed during Operation Iceberg.\n- Camp Courtney, where the 3rd Marine Division (United States) was located, was named after Major Henry A. Courtney Jr.",
